# Style Gate — Mandatory Two-Turn Protocol

Applies to **all agents** (desktop, mobile, cloud) when user uploads a **new scene** for Tom/James/virtual-couple/换脸/小红书.

**Exception — pose-series:** If the input is an already-approved character still and the user wants 系列/换姿态, follow `.cursor/skills/pose-series/SKILL.md`.

**Exception — text-scene:** If there is **no scene photo** and the user gave a **text** brief, do **not** use the clothing template below. Follow `.cursor/skills/text-scene/SKILL.md`: post the filled scene card and STOP.

## Turn 1: ASK ONLY — never generate

If the user has **not** replied with customization choices in this conversation:

1. Analyze the scene
2. Post numbered text options (accessories, top color, top pattern, bottom color) per character
3. End with: `⏸️ 请回复后我再生成图片。`
4. **STOP — do not call GenerateImage in this turn**

## Turn 2: Generate only after user reply

Call GenerateImage **only after** user replies with numbers/text, or if their **first message** already said e.g. `全部保持原场景` or `角色默认，上衣藏青`.

## Text options template

```
✅ 场景已分析（构图/动作/环境将保持不变）

【James】
1️⃣ 装饰物：1保持原场景 2角色默认(无眼镜) 3墨镜 4耳机 5无
2️⃣ 上衣：1保持 2白 3藏青 4浅蓝 5黑
3️⃣ 图案：1保持 2纯色 3条纹 4格子
4️⃣ 下装：1保持 2黑 3灰 4藏青

⏸️ 请回复后我再生成图片。
```

(Add Tom block for couple scenes.)

## Forbidden

- Calling GenerateImage before user confirms style choices
- Skipping options because AskQuestion is unavailable
- Running full pipeline in one turn when user did not pre-specify choices
